abstract: >-
  An educational prototype that uses Qiskit Aer to simulate a simplified
  teleportation-style Quantum Digital Signature session and demonstrate
  statistical deviation scoring, an error-rate check, and rule-based risk posture.
keywords:
  - quantum circuit simulation
  - Qiskit
  - cyber threat detection
  - statistical anomaly scoring
